	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ago tibi gr[ati]as, quas mallem, si possem, referre, quod tua opera filius noster <persName ref="p20260">Ale<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>xander</persName> usus est stipendio <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> et quod liberos meos istac transeuntes tam benigne <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>semper tractaris; reddat tibi dominus, boni omnis remunerator.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Literae <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniae</placeName> bona fide re<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mitto hic, ut vides; legimus omnes, gr[ati]as agimus deo, qui filii sui regnum dilatare pergit <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>fratresque nobis adiicere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod Luterani nos, quos vocant <persName>Zvinglianos</persName>, odio <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>habent et maledictis prosequuntur, novum non est; ipse enim hic expertus sum, quam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>abominentur nos.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p654">Pater Comander</persName> ex hoc melius sperat mecumque iocatus dixit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>solenne esse malis daemonibus, ut, cum cogantur exire ab hominibus, torqueant eos acerbius.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Sic auguratur ex istis intemperiis in propinquo esse, ut succumbant carnivorae <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>isti.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nova habemus nulla, quae certo scribi possint.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Die dominica erunt hic <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>comicia propter controversiam inter capitaneum nostrum et vicarium in <placeName ref="l520">Valle [Tel]<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>lina</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Consul <persName ref="p2043">Ambrosius Martinus</persName> hodie iussit nos te salutare; resalu<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tat praetor noster <persName ref="p3196">Ioannes Tschernerus</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontisella</persName>, cum primis <persName ref="p654">Comander</persName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Ex <placeName ref="l98">Curia</placeName>, die 29. iulii anni 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Tuae humanitatis totus <persName ref="p8359">Gallicius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Vere magno viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino suo sibi bonisque <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>omnibus colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
